  "satirlar": {
    "1": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_0f96a5df624294a7",
      "Lost? Yeah. Two of my people and every bag we had.. We were loading at a warehouse when the horde came down the street. Dropped everything and ran",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:61"
      ]
    ],
    "2": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_20ca8f9d08beaad9",
      "Lost is one word for it.. We had the truck half packed at a warehouse when the dead poured in. Left it all. Left Earl too",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:62"
      ]
    ],
    "3": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_19a8e8db4d2f3820",
      "Get that barrel off me and maybe we talk",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:64"
      ]
    ],
    "4": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_308a28753245d450",
      "I don't talk business down a gun. Lower it",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:64"
      ]
    ],
    "5": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_33e86aae0ee7f71d",
      "You're bleeding on my boots, friend.. Sit down a second. We dropped our bags at a warehouse when the horde came through",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:65"
      ]
    ],
    "6": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_57d56d4f1ed09c63",
      "A badge. Huh. Thought you folks all ran for Louisville.. Fine. We lost our bags at a warehouse when the horde came through",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:66"
      ]
    ],
    "7": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_3c6504287785e720",
      "Because I watched Earl go under three of them right there in the loading bay.. I'm not walking back in there. I can't",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:67"
      ]
    ],
    "8": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_4ed30c1a3c9248d0",
      "Shells. Bandages. Food I've been sitting on. And I'll owe you, which out here still means something",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:68"
      ]
    ],
    "9": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_0f2b31207b572b44",
      "Folks say you're straight. So you get the good stuff.. shells, bandages, a walkie, and food I've been hoarding",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:69"
      ]
    ],
    "10": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_5c02f91563c6ddaf",
      "I heard about you.. I'll pay when the bag's in my hands, not a second before",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:70"
      ]
    ],
    "11": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_77be84054c4bdc8b",
      "It's a {place}, about {dist} meters {dir} of here. Brown duffel, Earl's name on the strap. Watch the loading bay",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:71"
      ]
    ],
    "12": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_3594fa0824f4c7a2",
      "Good, keep that out, you'll need it.. {place}, about {dist} meters {dir}. Brown duffel. Earl's name on the strap",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:72"
      ]
    ],
    "13": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_2516803d049f7571",
      "Patch yourself up first, I mean it.. {place}, about {dist} meters {dir}. Brown duffel, Earl's name on the strap",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:73"
      ]
    ],
    "14": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_2716fd6a71d01932",
      "I'd point you there but I can't even tell where we are anymore.. Ask me again somewhere else",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:74"
      ]
    ],
    "15": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_1e8366cd2b507060",
      "Figured. Nobody walks into a warehouse for a stranger anymore",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:75"
      ]
    ],
    "16": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_6678d5ce4eb82811",
      "Yeah.. can't blame you",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:75"
      ]
    ],
    "17": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_497b8eb26408a644",
      "Changed your mind? The bag's still out there. So are the dead",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:76"
      ]
    ],
    "18": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_12b61ca017224269",
      "{place}. About {dist} meters {dir}. You'll smell it before you see it",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:77"
      ]
    ],
    "19": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_45e5057e39197fe7",
      "Then I'll go myself. God help me",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:78"
      ]
    ],
    "20": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_09fbf14c4e6c3585",
      "You went through Wade's boys? Over my bags? You're either brave or you don't care anymore.. either way, thank you",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:79"
      ]
    ],
    "21": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_62e06c1870a2c440",
      "You talked Wade Pruitt out of something? Eleven years I've known that man and never once.. thank you",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:80"
      ]
    ],
    "22": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_092698c14c935f98",
      "You ran with it. Smart.. Wade holds a grudge though. Watch the roads for a while",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:81"
      ]
    ],
    "23": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_617f17bd58067e9e",
      "Half's gone.. still more than I had this morning. Thank you",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:82"
      ]
    ],
    "24": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_23a96ad94cdced78",
      "That's it. That's Earl's bag.. I don't know what to say. Here, take this. You earned it",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:83"
      ]
    ],
    "25": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_0f56814857731f95",
      "Wade's crew took it? ..You came back breathing. That's worth more than what was in that bag. Mostly",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:84"
      ]
    ],
    "26": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_03a8252f1e811bce",
      "Getting by. Some days I still hear that loading bay",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:85"
      ]
    ],
    "27": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_44d90cf5477e7d46",
      "Keep your head down out there. Wade won't forget your face",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:85"
      ]
    ],
    "28": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_517459064d59260b",
      "Not now. Something's wrong out there",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:86"
      ]
    ],
    "29": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_571051522f138b69",
      "So.. those bags. You thinking about it or what",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:87"
      ]
    ],
    "30": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_3bab985723bb43e1",
      "You again. Still not your problem, huh",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:88"
      ]
    ],
    "31": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_45078e1e29741bd7",
      "You're back. Tell me you found the place",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:89"
      ]
    ],
    "32": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_24c9f1241384d80a",
      "You look like hell.. what happened out there",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:90"
      ]
    ],
    "33": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_3c79513b58a2cf60",
      "Smart. Slow now.. hands where I can see 'em and out the front. Don't look back",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:91"
      ]
    ],
    "34": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_1dedc44a159437d3",
      "..Roof's empty and we both know it. But I ain't paid enough to find out. Go on. Git",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:92"
      ]
    ],
    "35": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_1d7dcf205349c652",
      "Nice try. Boys",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:93"
      ]
    ],
    "36": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_593228af535bdfcf",
      "Now you're talking. Half the cans, half the shells.. pleasure doing business",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:94"
      ]
    ],
    "37": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_69943f663b411b7a",
      "We watch the warehouses, friend. Let you folks do the clearing, then we collect. Nothing personal",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:95"
      ]
    ],
    "38": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_2e0572fb14e1c680",
      "Then it's your funeral",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:96"
      ]
    ],
    "39": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_7ac981571e4772de",
      "Whoa. Whoa, easy. That bag ain't yours",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:97"
      ]
    ],
    "40": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_5584038a69668c34",
      "Set it down. Hands where I can see 'em. Walk out the front and nobody bleeds",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:98"
      ]
    ],
    "41": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_41f9677151b9f5b2",
      "Don't you even think about raising that",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:99"
      ]
    ],
    "42": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_14b5fae0683ed7d3",
      "Still waiting on you",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:100"
      ]
    ],
    "43": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_7b8bbbb56ba38110",
      "Bag down. Hands up. Last time I ask nice",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:100"
      ]
    ],
    "44": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_5a8f668b2103edb7",
      "You hear me in there?",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:100"
      ]
    ],
    "45": [
      "RD_ALifeLine_1af4edc713210824",
      "Clock's running, friend",
      [
        "shared/ProjectALife/Missions/ALifeMissionDefs.lua:100"
      ]
    ]
  }
}
